"Apogee Artist Spaces is a six-story Apex building of studios rented to artists by the month."
"It has white concrete walls and no ground-floor windows."
"Its door is a Wrightmade puzzle of colored metal pieces, each an enchanted code button."
"A cartoon seal animation greets visitors and advertises on screens inside."
"Ground-floor boom rooms are windowless reinforced concrete boxes for violent power-based art."
"The sixth-floor gallery has windows on four sides and life-sized reaching figure sculptures."
"The Long siblings keep Boom Room 6 as a private training dungeon full of creatures and traps."
"Alden broke in by lifting the door's enchantment during the Matadero disaster."
